== Description ==

'''Titanium Bullet Tip''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 6 downstream recipes at the [[Gunsmith Workbench]], including [[7.62x39mm Titanium]], [[7.62x51mm Titanium]], [[7.62x54mm Titanium]], [[9x19mm Titanium]], [[D45 Titanium]], [[5.56x45mm Titanium]]. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

